Valerie: Is there anyone who you have enough information to convince?
Lizzy: Lets see… Well, at around twelve Barb’s dress rips, and Noah gets hauled to detention.
Lizzy: It was actually so weird Barb told this really personal story about getting lost in the woods that she hasn't told to anyone else-
